summary:
  This daily radiology news digest highlights advancements in AI for AI safety and teleradiology, along with findings regarding early heart disease detection and potential new treatments for heart disease and sepsis. Several articles discuss earlier onset of heart disease in men and the limitations of collagen supplements for skin health.

